      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Three Bedroom Cottage Style Residence with great Character and standing on a beautifully appointed Circa 0.5 st acre site.\n\nGVM Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this superb semi-detached, cottage style residence, standing on a beautifully appointed site extending to circa 0.5 acres. Set in a peaceful rural location, this property is just five minutes` drive from Croom and 20 minutes from Limerick City, with convenient access also to both Charleville and Cork City.\n\nExtended and refurbished to a very high standard in recent years, this wonderful home retains its cottage charm while offering bright, comfortable accommodation. The ground floor comprises a spacious front lounge, a fitted kitchen, a dining area overlooking the patio and rear garden, and a guest WC. Upstairs are three double bedrooms and a beautifully fitted main bathroom.\n\nFeatures include oil-fired central heating, double glazed uPVC windows, a new BioCycle wastewater treatment unit, a private water well, a security alarm and an excellent BER rating of C. Good parking and circulation area.Large garden shed included. Manicured and private site complimented with mature shrubs and floral beds.\n\nThis is a charming home offers all the benefits of country living yet is within easy reach of amenities. Inspection is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation:\n\nLounge: 6.4 m × 4.7 m. Spacious reception room with solid wood flooring, a feature fireplace and staircase to the first floor.\n\n\nKitchen: 4.6 m × 3.2 m. Beautifully fitted Shrewsbury cream kitchen with tiled flooring and generous floor and eye-level units.\n\n\nDining area: 3.4 m × 3.3 m. Tiled flooring and patio doors opening onto the rear patio and garden.\n\n\nGuest WC: 2.1 m × 1.0 m. Fully fitted and tiled, with WC and wash hand basin.\n\n\nFirst Floor\n\nlanding: Spacious landing providing access to the bedrooms and main bathroom.\n\n\nBedroom 1: 4.7 m × 3.2 m. Spacious double bedroom.\n\n\nBedroom 2: 3.6 m × 3.3 m. Double bedroom.\n\n\nBedroom 3: 3.6 m × 3.1 m. Double bedroom.\n\n\nMain bathroom: Beautifully fitted and tiled, with modern finishes and attractive sanitary ware.\n\nInspection of this hugely attractive property is very highly recommended.\n"
      },
